   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "Take the numerator N = 3x + 1 and the denominator D = x - 2, so N' = 3 and D' = 1.",
         "mathjson": 3
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "The quotient rule gives h'(x) = (D N' - N D')/D^2 = (3(x - 2) - (3x + 1))/(x - 2)^2.",
